sequence Recording a pageview
// From: lib/plausible_web/controllers/api/external_controller.ex:13, lib/plausible/ingestion/request.ex:79, lib/plausible/ingestion/event.ex:56,137,
// lib/plausible/site/gate_keeper.ex:31, lib/plausible/ingestion/persistor/embedded.ex:8, lib/plausible/session/cache_store.ex:16,
// lib/plausible/ingestion/write_buffer.ex:12,89, lib/plausible/clickhouse_event_v2.ex:10
tag Role as r
  Client blue
  Service green
  Datastore purple

Browser r: Client
ExternalController r: Service
Ingestion.Request r: Service
Ingestion.Event r: Service
GateKeeper r: Service
Persistor.Embedded r: Service
Session.CacheStore r: Service
Session.Balancer r: Service
Event.WriteBuffer r: Service
ClickHouse r: Datastore

Browser -POST /api/event-> ExternalController
ExternalController -build(conn)-> Ingestion.Request
Ingestion.Request -> ExternalController
ExternalController -build_and_buffer-> Ingestion.Event
Ingestion.Event -check(domain)-> GateKeeper
GateKeeper -allow or deny-> Ingestion.Event
note right of Ingestion.Event
  Runs the pipeline of steps in order:
  shield rules, geolocation, user agent,
  source info, salts, user id, validate.
  The first step to drop the event halts it.
Ingestion.Event -persist_event-> Persistor.Embedded
Persistor.Embedded -on_event-> Session.CacheStore
Session.CacheStore -dispatch by user_id-> Session.Balancer
Session.Balancer -find or create session-> Session.CacheStore
Persistor.Embedded -insert(event)-> Event.WriteBuffer
Event.WriteBuffer ~flush on tick or full~> ClickHouse
ExternalController -202 ok-> Browser
